# Will the Seal Be Broken (Q003), the kill lands from the character's servitor: the killer's acting player
# is the owner, so the omen beast drops the onyx beast eye to the owner as if it had struck itself.
# Hand-written from the quest script (no reference trace).
character Darkling 16
class 31
script quest.Q003_WillTheSealBeBroken
item 1081 1082 1083 956
page default/30141.htm
page script/quest/Q003_WillTheSealBeBroken/
quest Q003_WillTheSealBeBroken <cond>=1 <state>=STARTED
npc beast 20031 Monster 40 0 0
summon pet 14001 servitor 16

hit beast 100000 by pet
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0

# The beast's dying hook runs three seconds after the kill.
advance 3s
  S SystemMessage id=54 3:1081
  S PlaySound type=0 file=ItemSound.quest_middle bind=0 obj=0 loc=0,0,0 delay=0
  rows Q003_WillTheSealBeBroken <cond>=1 <state>=STARTED
  items 1081=1
  items 1081=1
